data security and data integrity.</span><br /> <br /> <span class=\"italic\"><p>Instructions:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Write a 120-150 word text where you explain the concept of Data Security and Data Integrity.</li>\n<li>The text can be either a short essay, informal mail, business mail or a blog.</li>\n<li>Include the analysis of how data security and data integrity were in the past. </li>\n<li>Write meaningful sentences that explain the purpose of data security and data integrity nowadays.</li>\n<li>Describe common activities related to data security and data integrity.</li><br />\n<p>When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <strong>Go to Writing Task</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Data Security and Data Integrity</strong></p></span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"content": "It's time to review your draft.</p>\n<p>When you are writing a text, remember to include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A purpose</li>\n<li>A leading idea</li>\n<li>Different structures of sentences in different lengths. </li>\n<li>Key words in order to emphasize.</li>\n<li>Action verbs.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Proofread your text for any spelling, grammar or punctuation errors.</p>\n<p>Read your text aloud to a partner.</p>\n<p>Click the <strong>Submit </strong>button to save your work.</p></em>", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"grading_contents": {"header": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content_type": "text", "c