", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "type": "RSLT"}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "enpe7n3le01ob06re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Let's make a brochure to explain Data Security and Data Integrity!", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 12, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"coverimg": "enpe7n3le01ob06re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "How to write meaningful sentences in order to explain the concept of data security and data integrity: a simple formula to follow.<br/><br/>First, you need to understand your audience. In the past, probably, you wrote without having a clear understanding of your audience. They didn't know what the topic was about. You need to consider what you know about your audience. <br/>", "image": "enpe7n3le01ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 0}, {"time": "26500", "text": "Likewise, your audience needs to read and write about data security and data integrity. Now that you know what they want, you need to start with a little research. Consequently, you read and analyze information related to data security and data integrity.<br/>\nFor instance, data security and data integrity are two broad concepts that come from database administration. This is the management of database systems. Data security, regarding databases, is the form to ensure sensitive data.  This consist of the assignment and control of users' level of access. Moreover, it is the use of monitoring tools to detect a compromise, diversion, or unauthorized change to database files. When data is exclusive, licensing agreements with both database vendors and content providers may also be required.<br/>", "image": "enpe7n3le01ob06re2img02.jpg", "id": 1}, {"time": "88000", "text": "Data integrity is associated with data security since the completeness and accuracy of data can be compromised, stolen or damaged. Therefore, data integrity develops and test procedures for the entry and verification of data (input) as well as verifying the accuracy of reports (output). Data security, as well as data integrity, were not important a few years ago. Nowadays, database administrators work with the programming staff in maintaining data integrity. Companies hire businesses to help them to have their data protected in order to satisfy the customer needs. Within the database structure itself, data administrators and the staff maintain the links between data fields and a locking system.", "image": "enpe7n3le01ob06re2img03.jpg", "id": 2}], "audiosrc": "enpe7n3le01ob06re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "title": "", "id": 1, "type": "audio"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "image": "", "id": 0}], "video_src": "enpe7n3le01ob06re5vsc01"}, "type": "video"}], "title": "", "id": 5, "type": "video"}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar"}]}